  "notes": "Target grid requires average salary by age and service. Source tables are Exhibit A (BRS excluding Teachers) and Exhibit C (Teachers) on pages 49 and 51. Each exhibit contains interleaved rows: one for member counts and one for average salary. Source table 0 and 2 are the average salary tables; source table 1 and 3 are the corresponding count tables used as weights. The 'Unknown' age row in Exhibit A is excluded from mapping as it does not fit the target age bins. The '70 & over' target bin is derived by weighted averaging the '65-69' and '70 & over' source rows. The '40' service target bin is derived by weighted averaging the '35-39' and '40 & over' source columns. The 'Unknown' row in Exhibit A is not mapped. The 'Total' column in source tables is not used.",
